{"id":"H2780","lemma":"חָרֵף","transliteration":"chareph","sayIt":"cha-REPH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Hareph","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.51;\nson of: Hur (H2354);\nbrother of: Uri (H0221), Shobal (H7732H), Salma (H8007H), Jezreel (H3157J), Ishma (H3457), Idbash (H3031), Hazzelelponi (H6753), Penuel (H6439H) and Ezer (H5829)\n§ Hareph = \"a plucking off\"\na son of Caleb and father of Bethgader","glosses":["hareph"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":51,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Hareph","kjv":"Hareph"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:51","note":"Salma the father of Bethlehem, and Hareph the father of Beth Gader.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0221","lemma":"אוּרִי","transliteration":"uri","gloss":"Uri"},{"id":"H2354","lemma":"חוּר","transliteration":"chur","gloss":"Hur"},{"id":"H7732","lemma":"שׁוֹבָל","transliteration":"shoval","gloss":"Shobal"},{"id":"H8007","lemma":"שַׂלְמָא","transliteration":"salma","gloss":"Salmon"},{"id":"H3157","lemma":"יִזְרְעֶאל","transliteration":"yizreel","gloss":"Jezreel"},{"id":"H3457","lemma":"יִשְׁמָא","transliteration":"yishma","gloss":"Ishma"},{"id":"H3031","lemma":"יִדְבָּשׁ","transliteration":"yidbash","gloss":"Idbash"},{"id":"H6753","lemma":"הַצְּלֶלְפּוֹנִי","transliteration":"tselelponi","gloss":"Hazzelelponi"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}